{"4925450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Enu", "steam_appid": 4925450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/d8ee723b77044074dc2c61c36ee2cdd0.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1418 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/fa67285e43e878f26af601a610ba390c.avif?t=1787770467\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras_big/fa67285e43e878f26af601a610ba390c.webp?t=1787770467 width=1560 height=821 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Enu you are playing four platformers in four worlds at once. One world in each direction. Each world has its own mysteries, challenges and conflicts you are tasked to resolve. While the worlds are seperated and lesser creations are bound to their worlds, the nethershades and their creations aren't. They linger in the aetherveil, a realm outside of lesser beings reach, and corrupt everything. You take on the role of a Veilkin, a mysterious being, thats able to travel between the worlds through the aetherveil in order to reunite the realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/5bd29aeda84e75ceb3ac8d6ef37a851e.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1076 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/eb61d1e3251b9dbdaf6f2aa4fdc6b2cb.poster.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/eb61d1e3251b9dbdaf6f2aa4fdc6b2cb.webm?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/eb61d1e3251b9dbdaf6f2aa4fdc6b2cb.mp4?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rotation is a versatile ability with many different purposes. It lets you rotate into other worlds through the Aetherveil. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release the Meteor:</strong> Perform a special attack after rotating to another world and defeat whole groups of enemies at once with this powerful Meteor attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge lethal Attacks:</strong> Many Enemies in Enu are bound to their world - and so are their attacks. By rotating to a different world, you can dodge every attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve tricky Puzzles:</strong> Overcome obstacles or solve Puzzles by using the rotation in creative ways to unlock alternative rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/f5b2e8cc8a2577c30b6a0904ad05c8b2.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1076 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/1a9685761eac87cdec24e9b1dca878ae.poster.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/1a9685761eac87cdec24e9b1dca878ae.webm?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/1a9685761eac87cdec24e9b1dca878ae.mp4?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Enu, you can constantly find new Spells in form of Memories and Engrams that let you modify your Spells.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Spell, your Decision:</strong> Upon identifying a Memory, you can choose its form. Each Spell has a Core variant, less powerful but used more regularly, or a devastating Prime variant usable less often.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify your Spells:</strong> Engrams are used to modify your Core- and Prime-Skills in meaningful ways. By upgrading your Memories, you unlock Slots to infuse them with Engrams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20.000+ Combinations:</strong> With 20 unique Memories and 32 Engrams in the game, up to 12 different Engrams can fit into 3 Slots for Core Spells and 4 Slots for Prime Spells, which means there are more than 20.000 possible combinations to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/63229d281b5c308a9861c7f426ea8286.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1076 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/3aa8d9d6601b36116f692ecff84fd54e.poster.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/3aa8d9d6601b36116f692ecff84fd54e.webm?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/3aa8d9d6601b36116f692ecff84fd54e.mp4?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Skilltree in Enu has four paths, representing the four worlds, that can be mixed and matched by rotating its layers while progressing through it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Attack:</strong> Unlocking new Combo-Steps for your Base-Attack are the cornerstones of the Skilltree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotation Ability:</strong> Adjust your Meteor-Ability through nodes in the Skilltree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talents:</strong> Improve your power greatly by speccing into powerful passive Talents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affixes:</strong> Picking up the right passive Affixes on the way can refine your Build further.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/d8ee723b77044074dc2c61c36ee2cdd0.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1418 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/fa67285e43e878f26af601a610ba390c.avif?t=1787770467\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras_big/fa67285e43e878f26af601a610ba390c.webp?t=1787770467 width=1560 height=821 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Enu you are playing four platformers in four worlds at once. One world in each direction. Each world has its own mysteries, challenges and conflicts you are tasked to resolve. While the worlds are seperated and lesser creations are bound to their worlds, the nethershades and their creations aren't. They linger in the aetherveil, a realm outside of lesser beings reach, and corrupt everything. You take on the role of a Veilkin, a mysterious being, thats able to travel between the worlds through the aetherveil in order to reunite the realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/5bd29aeda84e75ceb3ac8d6ef37a851e.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1076 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/eb61d1e3251b9dbdaf6f2aa4fdc6b2cb.poster.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/eb61d1e3251b9dbdaf6f2aa4fdc6b2cb.webm?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/eb61d1e3251b9dbdaf6f2aa4fdc6b2cb.mp4?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rotation is a versatile ability with many different purposes. It lets you rotate into other worlds through the Aetherveil. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release the Meteor:</strong> Perform a special attack after rotating to another world and defeat whole groups of enemies at once with this powerful Meteor attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge lethal Attacks:</strong> Many Enemies in Enu are bound to their world - and so are their attacks. By rotating to a different world, you can dodge every attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve tricky Puzzles:</strong> Overcome obstacles or solve Puzzles by using the rotation in creative ways to unlock alternative rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/f5b2e8cc8a2577c30b6a0904ad05c8b2.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1076 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/1a9685761eac87cdec24e9b1dca878ae.poster.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/1a9685761eac87cdec24e9b1dca878ae.webm?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/1a9685761eac87cdec24e9b1dca878ae.mp4?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Enu, you can constantly find new Spells in form of Memories and Engrams that let you modify your Spells.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Spell, your Decision:</strong> Upon identifying a Memory, you can choose its form. Each Spell has a Core variant, less powerful but used more regularly, or a devastating Prime variant usable less often.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify your Spells:</strong> Engrams are used to modify your Core- and Prime-Skills in meaningful ways. By upgrading your Memories, you unlock Slots to infuse them with Engrams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20.000+ Combinations:</strong> With 20 unique Memories and 32 Engrams in the game, up to 12 different Engrams can fit into 3 Slots for Core Spells and 4 Slots for Prime Spells, which means there are more than 20.000 possible combinations to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/63229d281b5c308a9861c7f426ea8286.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1076 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/3aa8d9d6601b36116f692ecff84fd54e.poster.avif?t=1787770467\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/3aa8d9d6601b36116f692ecff84fd54e.webm?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/extras/3aa8d9d6601b36116f692ecff84fd54e.mp4?t=1787770467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Skilltree in Enu has four paths, representing the four worlds, that can be mixed and matched by rotating its layers while progressing through it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Attack:</strong> Unlocking new Combo-Steps for your Base-Attack are the cornerstones of the Skilltree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotation Ability:</strong> Adjust your Meteor-Ability through nodes in the Skilltree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talents:</strong> Improve your power greatly by speccing into powerful passive Talents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affixes:</strong> Picking up the right passive Affixes on the way can refine your Build further.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Enu is a hand-drawn 2D-Action-Platformer where you play as a Veilkin, traveling between realms by mastering the unique rotation mechanic. Collect, improve and customize a wide array of abilities to defeat enemy hordes and powerful bosses on an epic journey to reunite the realms.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/eb3e16f3acdd47ad2fb7df56071ce091449c66f6/header.jpg?t=1787770467", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/2557e78b850ce2438f79497811e32edd7e883658/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787770467", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/2557e78b850ce2438f79497811e32edd7e883658/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787770467", "website": "https://entertainment-software.com/enu/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240, AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB), Radeon HD 7750 (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ENSO"], "publishers": ["ENSO"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/2fd16a45cbf74afbf771a15622a1fd8ab9998062/ss_2fd16a45cbf74afbf771a15622a1fd8ab9998062.600x338.jpg?t=1787770467", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925450/2fd16a45cbf74afbf771a15622a1fd8ab9998062/ss_2fd16a45cbf74afbf771a15622a1fd8ab9998062.1920x1080.jpg?t=178